{
  "id": 8867158196423,
  "title": "Christmas Bedding Quilt – Soft Microfiber Holiday Bedsprea - Design 04",
  "handle": "christmas-bedding-quilt-soft-microfiber-holiday-bedsprea-design-04",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the festive spirit with this beautifully designed Christmas Quilt Set from Jeminise. Crafted for both warmth and holiday cheer, this quilt offers unmatched softness and breathability, bringing a joyful touch to your home decor throughout the season.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints that create a warm, joyful atmosphere, adding a festive touch to any room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes:</strong> Available in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit beds, sofas, or for use as a decorative seasonal quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, ensuring warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for year-round versatility.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or other holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry, ensuring fade-resistant and wrinkle-free softness for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one quilt, ready to enhance your holiday decor.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle; Tumble dry low or air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
